  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, rice vinegar, grated ginger, and minced garlic.",
    "Arrange the dumpling wrappers in a bamboo steamer, leaving space between each wrapper.",
    "Spoon a small amount of the soy sauce mixture onto each dumpling wrapper.",
    "Top each dumpling wrapper with a few raspberries.",
    "Drizzle the remaining soy sauce mixture over the raspberries.",
    "Steam the hot pot in the oven for 15 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and serve immediately."
